reatment products, while its 129 “filter” products are principally грязевики. A confirmed parser defect truncates “Кран БИВАЛ КШТ.11.050.025.ф/ф 50х25 КОФ” to “Кран БИВАЛ К”: the clause-end quantity pattern can recognize embedded “ШТ.” without a required leading token boundary. This is a general parsing error, not a one-off rule. No new evidence supports another branded-model suppression or source-enrichment refinement: three such attempts already increased hidden wrong-NOT_FOUND rate despite retaining original-query retrieval.', 'decision_impact': 'The main uncertainty is whether useful unresolved value is constrained by loss of query evidence during normalization and late fusion, or by genuine catalog-scope/service-consumable requests that should produce uncertainty rather than more retrieval. The Planner should distinguish these mechanisms. Do not select another endpoint/inch, branded-token suppression, or manufacturer-model enrichment variant without new causal evidence; those paths are already tested and unsafe.', 'unresolved': 'The review corpus is unresolved rather than outcome-labeled, so its category counts establish opportunity and scope but not end-to-end uplift. The supplied review-pool gzip remains corrupt; membership is reconstructable from the intact all-rows, labels, and provisional-NOT_FOUND files. It is also unmeasured whether correcting the canonical alternate changes the final top-20, because the original query is retained and may already supply the needed candidate.', 'sources': [], 'evidence_patterns': [{'pattern': 'Narrow additive retrieval normalization has conditional value; semantic expansion is not generally beneficial.', 'supporting_experiments': ['legacy-cycle-3 ACCEPTED: deterministic query canonicalization improved safely.', 'legacy-cycle-4 ACCEPTED: standalone WW expansion improved safely.', 'legacy-cycle-6 REJECTED: flanged-shorthand canonicalization regressed hidden safety.', 'legacy-cycle-9 REJECTED: standard-bore wording expansion